 +section('beyond','What the rate does not capture',para('This tool prices time, not the whole job. Tuition help, equipment, job security, promotion paths, and how the work fits your life can each be worth more than a small gap in effective rate. Health premiums and 401(k) matching are priced when you enter them above. Use the rate to see the time trade clearly, then decide with the full picture.')+para('All figures are gross. Taxes differ by income and location and are not calculated here. For pay after the deductions you enter, use the <a href="/paycheck-calculator/">paycheck calculator</a>.'))
